## Testing Strategy

### Test Cases

```python
test_queries = [
    # Original issue
    ("give the vehicle number columns in all tables", "metadata"),
    
    # Variations
    ("vehicle columns in all tables", "metadata"),
    ("show me truck number columns across all tables", "metadata"),
    ("which columns represent vehicle ID in each table", "metadata"),
    
    # Should NOT trigger (data queries)
    ("give me vehicle numbers from all tables", "data"),
    ("list all vehicle numbers", "data"),
    
    # Edge cases
    ("vehicle number columns in vts_truck_master", "schema"),  # Single table
    ("common vehicle columns in alerts and vts_truck_master", "schema"),  # Intersection
]
```

### Expected Behavior

| Query Type | Handler | Output Type |
|------------|---------|-------------|
| "X columns in all tables" | Deterministic | Column names (metadata) |
| "X in all tables" | LLM | Actual data |
| "columns in TABLE" | Schema Introspection | Column names from information_schema |

